    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Magic is dying from the world... but still, there are the Immortal Magi.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i> Immortal Magus,</i> you as one of the titular sorcerers must save ancient Britain from the demon, Mephisto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a throwback to a nigh-forgotten subgenre of strategy games, called 'artillery games.' You must throw projectiles at your opponents to eliminate them - carefully calculating the trajectory, and the effect of the wind. A variety of different spells (which act as the projectiles) can be used to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >voice-acted Story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >customizable two-player Skirmish mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destructible environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >variety of different spells, including a Spell Editor in Story Mode to craft your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multitude of Units to create</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704560/extras/591f9a21f6f31265f21d252f53932a15.poster.avif?t=1747457715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704560/extras/591f9a21f6f31265f21d252f53932a15.webm?t=1747457715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704560/extras/591f9a21f6f31265f21d252f53932a15.mp4?t=1747457715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Magic is dying from the world... but still, there are the Immortal Magi.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i> Immortal Magus,</i> you as one of the titular sorcerers must save ancient Britain from the demon, Mephisto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a throwback to a nigh-forgotten subgenre of strategy games, called 'artillery games.' You must throw projectiles at your opponents to eliminate them - carefully calculating the trajectory, and the effect of the wind. A variety of different spells (which act as the projectiles) can be used to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >voice-acted Story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >customizable two-player Skirmish mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destructible environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >variety of different spells, including a Spell Editor in Story Mode to craft your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multitude of Units to create</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704560/extras/591f9a21f6f31265f21d252f53932a15.poster.avif?t=1747457715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704560/extras/591f9a21f6f31265f21d252f53932a15.webm?t=1747457715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704560/extras/591f9a21f6f31265f21d252f53932a15.mp4?t=1747457715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Immortal Magus is a throwback to old 'artillery' games such as Scorched Earth or Pocket Tanks, but in a fantasy setting. In a simple mixture of turn-based and real-time strategy, defeat your enemy by hurling spells and summoning Units in destructible environments.",
